              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:#767677;margin:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;">Clean lines meet bold performance. Every detail serves a purpose — because great design is about what you don't see.</p>
            </td>
